tention feeding declarations, landed on\n2026-09-20 in futon2 3b5557aa.\n\n### tl;dr\n\n- [ ] The A query interface has a WMC backend using cached SDD compilations of the declared common-cause model.\n- [ ] WMC marginal and joint queries match exact enumeration, including the matched-marginal total-G invariance control under point beliefs and product preferences.\n- [ ] Compiled query means and variances match small-model calculations while preserving shared rate-parameter identity.\n- [ ] Compiled joint queries compute the state-observation mutual information needed for total G under spread beliefs.\n- [ ] Compilation cost, memory use, and repeated-query latency are measured on actual candidate families."}], :pinned-at "2026-09-21T03:41:48.035185967Z", :tension-rule :lifecycle-sections}, :pattern-source {:id "/home/joe/code/futon3/library/pattern-interpretation/cite-the-source-bytes.flexiarg#dfaa2e87552c6fde152cc9f54a9a5377cce4246f690932b1e0c1bc98c8c4b285", :path "/home/joe/code/futon3/library/pattern-interpretation/cite-the-source-bytes.flexiarg", :file "3f9c394e4165318284aed4c0e13dcebb9f902a4d8d80fa5f840c001a413d3bd8-dfaa2e87552c6fde152cc9f54a9a5377cce4246f690932b1e0c1bc98c8c4b285.source", :sha256 "dfaa2e87552c6fde152cc9f54a9a5377cce4246f690932b1e0c1bc98c8c4b285", :revision "7fc6a05004aa3e601e53eba633d62213da0af4b2"}, :retrieval [{:retriever "embedding", :rank 36, :retriever-rank 36, :raw {:pattern_id "pattern-interpretation/cite-the-source-bytes", :embedding_rank 36, :relevance 0.38263968343167515, :posterior_mean 0.5, :posterior_n 0, :label "self-graded", :posterior_rank 36}}]}, :proposal-id "8502b4c173f8dda4159a48c71586bcb3c3593b88ad6798c745dd61fad613ce41"} {:schema :wm/cascade-proposal-v1, :status :proposed, :origin :retrieval-proposed, :target "M-a-wmc-scaling", :pattern "pattern-interpretation/put-uncertainty-in-theta", :evidence {:target {:id "M-a-wmc-scaling", :kind :mission, :source "/home/joe/code/futon2/holes/M-a-wmc-scaling.md#40a494e8d9f24c344cc47363