rs above govern, and one could fire first.\nTrigger (a)'s premise, hole retention feeding declarations, landed on\n2026-09-20 in futon2 3b5557aa.\n\n### tl;dr\n\n- [ ] The A query interface has a WMC backend using cached SDD compilations of the declared common-cause model.\n- [ ] WMC marginal and joint queries match exact enumeration, including the matched-marginal total-G invariance control under point beliefs and product preferences.\n- [ ] Compiled query means and variances match small-model calculations while preserving shared rate-parameter identity.\n- [ ] Compiled joint queries compute the state-observation mutual information needed for total G under spread beliefs.\n- [ ] Compilation cost, memory use, and repeated-query latency are measured on actual candidate families."}], :pinned-at "2026-09-21T03:41:48.035185967Z", :tension-rule :lifecycle-sections}, :pattern-source {:id "/home/joe/code/futon3/library/problems/process-conduct-is-unassured.flexiarg#563b4c5743510ee632867f462cad005c0a8d75f34b1b0d1a5c432168f2dcc00a", :path "/home/joe/code/futon3/library/problems/process-conduct-is-unassured.flexiarg", :file "38f059ace3b2663900c1f92ef4ab3eb3c7ff9cfab602b05af3bb36c15e3cedf2-563b4c5743510ee632867f462cad005c0a8d75f34b1b0d1a5c432168f2dcc00a.source", :sha256 "563b4c5743510ee632867f462cad005c0a8d75f34b1b0d1a5c432168f2dcc00a", :revision "7fc6a05004aa3e601e53eba633d62213da0af4b2"}, :retrieval [{:retriever "embedding", :rank 16, :retriever-rank 16, :raw {:pattern_id "problems/process-conduct-is-unassured", :embedding_rank 16, :relevance 0.4081743595154655, :posterior_mean 0.5, :posterior_n 0, :label "self-graded", :posterior_rank 16}}]}, :proposal-id "088fb259d9df46dc53f542ba43312ed0a12fbf26d5ce33eb7312517253d20713"} {:schema :wm/cascade-proposal-v1, :status :proposed, :origin :retrieval-proposed, :target "M-a-wmc-scaling", :pattern "problems/r13-temporal-policy-depth", :evidence {:target {:id "M-a-wmc-scaling", :kind :mission, :source "/home/joe/code/futon2/holes/M-a-