vern, and one could fire first.\nTrigger (a)'s premise, hole retention feeding declarations, landed on\n2026-09-20 in futon2 3b5557aa.\n\n### tl;dr\n\n- [ ] The A query interface has a WMC backend using cached SDD compilations of the declared common-cause model.\n- [ ] WMC marginal and joint queries match exact enumeration, including the matched-marginal total-G invariance control under point beliefs and product preferences.\n- [ ] Compiled query means and variances match small-model calculations while preserving shared rate-parameter identity.\n- [ ] Compiled joint queries compute the state-observation mutual information needed for total G under spread beliefs.\n- [ ] Compilation cost, memory use, and repeated-query latency are measured on actual candidate families."}], :pinned-at "2026-09-21T03:41:48.035185967Z", :tension-rule :lifecycle-sections}, :pattern-source {:id "/home/joe/code/futon3/library/social/ARGUMENT.flexiarg#92b88e1d9209af8bf96e2495bdc628b556dc3ea9f1b3f0e2a0bc86cfd4569fc3", :path "/home/joe/code/futon3/library/social/ARGUMENT.flexiarg", :file "4db84cdcb033d27eab1ff232023440dcb532d3fe46c2102d9fe2a22ac4dc573e-92b88e1d9209af8bf96e2495bdc628b556dc3ea9f1b3f0e2a0bc86cfd4569fc3.source", :sha256 "92b88e1d9209af8bf96e2495bdc628b556dc3ea9f1b3f0e2a0bc86cfd4569fc3", :revision "7fc6a05004aa3e601e53eba633d62213da0af4b2"}, :retrieval [{:retriever "embedding", :rank 14, :retriever-rank 14, :raw {:pattern_id "social/ARGUMENT", :embedding_rank 14, :relevance 0.40922757976190993, :posterior_mean 0.5, :posterior_n 0, :label "self-graded", :posterior_rank 14}}]}, :proposal-id "3ddfe9cb9f26a5b4a8f393aa348202586835e914adba5052d3c0e1aef51b5d35"} {:schema :wm/cascade-proposal-v1, :status :proposed, :origin :retrieval-proposed, :target "M-a-wmc-scaling", :pattern "structure/interest-event-vocabulary", :evidence {:target {:id "M-a-wmc-scaling", :kind :mission, :source "/home/joe/code/futon2/holes/M-a-wmc-scaling.md#40a494e8d9f24c344cc473637f8f0a2ca64feaf4f836092f834493d3044a