 has not been registered yet. Line 4 of the mission says this exit was satisfied at DERIVE/INSTANTIATE-1.", :response-id "response-75f7af70cbde280f", :answered-by {:seat "claude-5", :job-id "invoke-1790384990445-24583-69181b7d"}}, :sidecar/explicit-promotion-to-facts {:request-id "request-750ea9b37bcb0ea0", :validator {:ns "futon2.aif.want-interpretation", :source-sha256 "8cfadab5696338e1c258dd64f4c21bf2c2206614283d428bd8bfb2a5868cbaa4"}, :source {:path "futon3/library/sidecar/explicit-promotion-to-facts.flexiarg", :sha256 "adf92965b95ce5487a2d0a50654d531ff13a4c9ab67bb86aed3045277cccefeb"}, :kind :machine-requested, :scope-limit "The pattern does not cover clause 2 (single-active: switch, never stack). The sidecar promotes into a set of facts and has no rule for one fact replacing another. The pattern's promotion is an act someone performs explicitly, not the operator's one-key confirm or hydra override. Automatic promotion that passes the gate and is logged satisfies the pattern, but only the witnessed-and-auditable half of clause 3, not the confirmable half. The 'ideally XTDB' existence witness does not carry over, and neither do the sidecar's SQLite, enum and score-bound checks.", :want :exit/h5c6933e5e2fc, :by "claude-5", :validated {:checks [:canonical-id :library-source-sha :produces-want :guard-tokens-known :owner-constraints :constructs-through-it :admitted], :candidate {:precedence [:orchestration/pattern-warranted-choice-point :sidecar/explicit-promotion-to-facts], :construction-receipt {:locator-coverage :token-set-not-supplied, :unknown-read-as-not-established [], :g-of-best {:value 23.36816913014941, :universe [:exit/h0c55648e57e5 :exit/h0f3acdf222d7 :exit/h1dae607747ce :exit/h203ce9577ebe :exit/h59adca2cd730 :exit/h5c6933e5e2fc :exit/h64ddcd0e8811 :exit/h7afd70f40a29]}, :moves [{:move-id :compose-by-need, :value 0.875, :g-comparison {:delta 0.875, :universe [:exit/h0c55648e57e5 :exit/h0f3acdf222d7 :exit/h1dae607747ce :exit/h203ce9577ebe :exit/h59adca2c