rate, does not restore, does not satisfy the ticket by existing.", :target-source {:repo "futon2", :path "holes/tickets/T-repair-occ-444fb018cbbb656d09b8f4f67c063f1d51a1932a9b1c281d999c567cf22a2ade.md", :section "Scoped task"}, :observation-limit "C4 observes the declaration's DISPOSITION LINE: HELD-OUT-SPLIT-DECLARED is written only when the split parses with its required fields (locator, held-out set, no-result/failure/timeout classes); a malformed declaration carries no such line and the token stays false."}, :aif/measurement-window-hygiene {:kind :hand-admitted, :by "zai-1", :date "2026-09-22", :source {:path "futon3/library/aif/measurement-window-hygiene.flexiarg", :sha256 "0d90eac2b154faf3a463ea7c20f7b597f44fee80b256046e7c6ad93792a16c73"}, :reading "With a valid split declared, the prospective held-out observations are COLLECTED through the split's window: the measurements the calibration layer needs. DECLARED EFFECT: produces exactly :repair/held-out-observations-collected from :repair/split-declared-valid.", :scope-limit "Collection only. Does not score, calibrate, or accept anything; outcomes that fail the window's hygiene are retained, not discarded.", :target-source {:repo "futon2", :path "holes/missions/M-aif-policy-conditioned-eig.md", :section "Completion criteria C9"}, :observation-limit "C4 observes the collection DISPOSITION LINE: HELD-OUT-OBSERVATIONS-COLLECTED is written only when the collection window closed with its observations retained; sufficiency for calibration is the next pattern's guard, not this token."}, :aif/two-layer-calibration {:kind :hand-admitted, :by "zai-1", :date "2026-09-22", :source {:path "futon3/library/aif/two-layer-calibration.flexiarg", :sha256 "76a281cd37088f9de561ff72f8d5874180d12fe2b1103f190e57d5cc196c8366"}, :reading "The collected observations become calibration EVIDENCE: held-out log-loss/Brier and predicted-versus-realised entropy reductions, the two-layer separation this pattern disciplines. DECLARED EFFECT: produces exactly :repair/calibration-evidence-present from :repair/held-out-observations-collected.", :scope-limit "Evidence only. Does not claim the obstruction removed unless the evidence says so, and does not accept the ticket.", :target-source {:repo "futon2", :path "holes/missions/M-aif-policy-conditioned-eig.md", :section "Completion criteria C9"}, :observation-limit "C4 observes the evidence's DISPOSITION LINE: CALIBRATION-EVIDENCE-PASSING is written only when the calibration record reports a passing result (held-out log-loss/Brier within the split's declared bounds); a record reporting FAILURE (or any non-passing verdict) carries a different disposition line and this token stays FALSE."}, :contracts/holder-states-the-claim {:kind :hand-admitted, :by "zai-1", :date "2026-09-22", :source {:path "futon3/library/contracts/holder-states-the-claim.flexiarg", :sha256 "63cf33d8fe678567813ce7499de94d0b241648ac8f3b33d2d9f506f462d2b12a"}, :reading "With calibration evidence present, the holder states the restoration claim and the ticket is accepted: the restore branch's terminal. DECLARED EFFECT: produces exactly :restoration-accepted from :repair/calibration-evidence-present.", :scope-limit "Restoration acceptance on evidence only. A declaration without collected observations and calibration evidence never reaches this guard.", :target-source {:repo "futon2", :path "holes/tickets/T-repair-occ-444fb018cbbb656d09b8f4f67c063f1d51a1932a9b1c281d999c567cf22a2ade.md", :section "Acceptance evidence"}, :observation-limit "C4 observes the ticket's Status line reading DONE; ordinary ticket review guards the transition."}}}, :action-at "2026-09-23T21:39:11.082698868Z", :action/value-sha256 "1a7220e756b4c75f5ed3c9707041eb3d26dacc1256afcd4c8283c557ffe25bbf", :action/id "action-5c1163d2-3e45-4fea-8919-6e2b41c6acfe", :transition/id "transition-8de59450-b5ef-4326-bb1a-12d4b97201ae", :cohort/id ":wm-contract-machinery-76-v1"}, :carry-occurrence-id "wm-live-selection-2026-09-23T21:38:43.905