1c281d999c567cf22a2ade.md", :decl "**Status:** DONE"}}, :construction-receipt {:kind :hand-admitted, :by "zai-1", :date "2026-09-22", :moves [], :stopped-is-not-success true, :reading "C1, the verify route: observe the condition (cleared branch), then accept on the dated observation. Reaches :restoration-accepted in 2 steps. If the observation is 'present', the cascade stops after step 1 and claims nothing."}, :interpretation-receipts {:apparatus/done-is-observed-running {:kind :hand-admitted, :by "zai-1", :date "2026-09-22", :source {:path "futon3/library/apparatus/done-is-observed-running.flexiarg", :sha256 "7f0c05735928fef7fdd95fcfcb369ae4bc39d2191d0a76104e2b4e26ec7621f9"}, :reading "The ticket's verify branch RUNS the precondition probe and records what it OBSERVES. The token is the observation disposition, not a file: :repair/obstruction-observed-cleared means the dated recheck observed the obstruction cleared. The condition the ticket's precondition names is the held-out EVIDENCE: the refused click-3 candidate needed a preregistered held-out split AND post-split outcomes. The recheck therefore observes CLEARED exactly when that evidence exists -- the guard requires :repair/calibration-evidence-present (the terminal form of the held-out evidence this source already defines: observations collected, then calibrated). With today's evidence absent (all three evidence C3 locators false), the recheck observes the obstruction PRESENT and this cascade produces nothing further -- no false completion; if the evidence were already present, C1 correctly reaches acceptance on its short path. DECLARED EFFECT: produces exactly :repair/obstruction-observed-cleared, only when the held-out calibration evidence is present.", :scope-limit "Models the cleared branch, which the ticket's 'if it has cleared' route accepts directly. The still-present branch is NOT claimed as completion: if the recheck observes the obstruction present, this cascade stops after the observation and the ticket stays open for the restore route -- the kernel's guard chain simply does not reach acceptance, and no completion token is produced. A single declared-source pattern cannot carry both observation outcomes (the kernel transition is deterministic, cascade_model_manifest.clj:282); the present-branch is therefore represented by NOT reaching the terminal, which is exactly the ticket's semantics.", :target-source {:repo "futon2", :path "holes/tickets/T-repair-occ-444fb018cbbb656d09b8f4f67c063f1d51a1932a9b1c281d999c567cf22a2ade.md", :section "Scoped task"}, :observation-limit "C4 observes the record's DISPOSITION LINE: the recheck record must carry a line starting RECHECK-DISPOSITION-CLEARED, written only when the dated check observed the obstruction cleared; a record whose disposition line reads RECHECK-DISPOSITION-PRESENT does not satisfy this token (decl-present?'s token boundary rejects differing heads)."}, :apparatus/evidence-to-disposition-once {:kind :hand-admitted, :by "zai-1", :date "2026-09-22", :source {:path "futon3/library/apparatus/evidence-to-disposition-once.flexiarg", :sha256 "9f6b75df557cb3475b320fba4c73f02761702b088ba3c7ca13aa99e666bba764"}, :reading "The ticket's 'if it has cleared, retain a dated recheck' branch: the dated observation IS the disposition; acceptance converts it once into the ticket's DONE state. DECLARED EFFECT: produces exactly :restoration-accepted from :repair/obstruction-observed-cleared.", :scope-limit "Only the cleared-branch acceptance. Does not accept on a present-observation or on any declaration.", :target-source {:repo "futon2", :path "holes/tickets/T-repair-occ-444fb018cbbb656d09b8f4f67c063f1d51a1932a9b1c281d999c567cf22a2ade.md", :section "Acceptance evidence"}, :observation-limit "C4 observes the ticket's Status line reading DONE; ordinary ticket review guards the transition."}, :aif/declare-the-conditioning {:kind :hand-admitted, :by "zai-1", :date "2026-09-22", :source {:path "futon3/library/aif/declare-the-conditioning.flexiarg", :sha256 "a70bdf4d1c172246503a1a3a55748e4362d1faeba56025b01d54980f25783135"}, :reading "The restore branch begins by declaring the held-out split before any outcomes exist. DECLARED EFFECT: produces exactly :repair/split-declared-valid -- a valid preregistered split declaration. The declaration ENABLES collecting prospective observations; it supplies no evidence itself.", :scope-limit "One declaration resource. Does not collect observations, does not calibrate, does not restore, does not satisfy the ticket by existing.", :target-source {:repo "futon2", :path "holes/tickets/T-repair-occ-444fb018cbbb656d09b8f4f67c063f1d51a1932a9b1c281d999c567cf22a2ade.md", :section "Scoped task"}, :observation-limit "C4 observes the declaration's DISPOSITION LINE: HELD-OUT-SPLIT-DECLARED is written only when the split parses with its required fields (locator, held-out set, no-result/failure/timeout classes); a malformed declaration carries no such line and the token stays false."}, :aif/measurement-window-hygiene {:kind :hand-admitted, :by "zai-1", :date "2026-09-22", :source {:path "futon3/library/aif/measurement-window-hygiene.flexiarg", :sha256 "0d90eac2b154faf3a463ea7c20f7b597f44fee80b256046e7c6ad93792a16c73"}, :reading "With a valid split declared, the prospective held-out observations are COLLECTED through the split's window: the measurements the calibration layer needs. DECLARED EFFECT: produces exactly :repair/held-out-observations-collected from :repair/split-declared-valid.", :scope-limit "Collection only. Does not score, calibrate, or accept anything; outcomes that fail the window's hygiene are retained, not discarded.", :target-source {:repo "futon2", :path "holes/missions/M-aif-policy-conditioned-eig.md", :section "Completion criteria C9"}, :observation-limit "C4 observes the collection DISPOSITION LINE: HELD-OUT-OBSERVATIONS-COLLECTED is written only when the collection window closed with its observations retained; sufficiency for calibration is the next pattern's guard, not this token."}, :aif/two-layer-calibration {:kind :hand-admitted, :by "zai-1", :date "2026-09-22", :source {:path "futon3/library/aif/two-layer-calibration.flexiarg", :sha256 "76a281cd37088f9de561ff72f8d5874180d12fe2b1103f190e57d5cc196c8366"}, :reading "The collected observations become calibration EVIDENCE: held-out log-loss/Brier and predicted-versus-realised entropy reductions, the two-layer separation this pattern disciplines. DECLARED EFFECT: produces exactly :repair/calibration-evidence-present from :repair/held-out-observations-collected.", :scope-limit "Evidence only. Does not claim the obstruction removed unless the evidence says so, and does not accept the ticket.", :target-source {:repo "futon2", :path "holes/missions/M-aif-policy-conditioned-eig.md", :section "Completion criteria C9"}, :observation-limit "C4 observes the evidence's DISPOSITION LINE: CALIBRATION-EVIDENCE-PASSING is written only when the calibration record reports a passing result (held-out log-loss/Brier within the split's declared bounds); a record reporting FAILURE (or any non-passing verdict) carries a different disposition line and this token stays FALSE."}, :contracts/holder-states-the-claim {:kind :hand-admitted, :by "zai-1", :date "2026-09-22", :source {:path "futon3/library/contracts/holder-states-the-claim.flexiarg", :sha256 "63cf33d8fe678567813ce7499de94d0b241648ac8f3b33d2d9f506f462d2b12a"}, :reading "With calibration evidence present, the holder states the restoration claim and the ticket is accepted: the restore branch's terminal. DECLARED EFFECT: produces exactly :restoration-accepted from :repair/calibration-evidence-present.", :scope-limit "Restoration acceptance on evidence only. A declaration without collected observations and calibration evidence never reaches this guard.", :target-source {:repo "futon2", :path "holes/tickets/T-repair-occ-444fb018cbbb656d09b8f4f67c063f1d51a1932a9b1c281d999c567cf22a2ade.md", :section "Acceptance evidence"}, :observation-l